      "en": "At that time, Herod the tetrarch heard the report concerning Jesus,",
      "ko": "그 때에 분봉왕 헤롯이 예수의 소문을 듣고",
      "source_text_hash": "b29a184e945b1f341f43aa239e02c2d03c8f7efd07d4733a40684fab5db5e617",
      "translation_text_hash": "b674b50b01f14421b2decce7a2d0c9a21427999039b949512a9d41dca86b89ad",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "그 때에 분봉왕 헤롯이 예수의 소문을 듣고"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "b674b50b01f14421b2decce7a2d0c9a21427999039b949512a9d41dca86b89ad"
      ]
    },
    {
      "canonical_locator": "bible:web:MAT:14:2",
      "sequence": 23600,
      "chapter_label": "MAT 14",
