      "en": "For John said to him, “It is not lawful for you to have her.”",
      "ko": "이는 요한이 헤롯에게 말하되 당신이 그 여자를 취한 것이 옳지 않다 하였음이라",
      "source_text_hash": "0da6b87c172bf03954c0adf3359cc4cba9e2543a2dbafbb123d7638d7ad54c0a",
      "translation_text_hash": "396f3bb0c5bd5399be528cb7a9571fb3c2acbc71bbf86d91f4f436ed905aca8d",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
