      "en": "When he would have put him to death, he feared the multitude, because they counted him as a prophet.",
      "ko": "헤롯이 요한을 죽이려 하되 민중이 저를 선지자로 여기므로 민중을 두려워하더니",
      "source_text_hash": "b321d6731ceeb7225e48091d7492edf07c1a2098a0a7dccd3240557c7a281096",
      "translation_text_hash": "9e3310d2e55759e1c34e0cad191d31fe25d8c32e841c4e5fed65e6795a078ae2",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "헤롯이 요한을 죽이려 하되 민중이 저를 선지자로 여기므로 민중을 두려워하더니"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "9e3310d2e55759e1c34e0cad191d31fe25d8c32e841c4e5fed65e6795a078ae2"
      ]
