      "en": "Therefore he promised with an oath to give her whatever she should ask.",
      "ko": "헤롯이 맹세로 그에게 무엇이든지 달라는대로 주겠다 허락하거늘",
      "source_text_hash": "d05e775fc0de48e9ff5aab8daa6a75593e16b70a03d4912827ee97072933c0d7",
      "translation_text_hash": "6528cc5873c143d6325253e70eb0d4670e7cabadb0c67900d6f881bcc255a1d9",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
