      "en": "The king was grieved, but for the sake of his oaths and of those who sat at the table with him, he commanded it to be given,",
      "ko": "왕이 근심하나 자기의 맹세한 것과 그 함께 앉은 사람들을 인하여 주라 명하고",
      "source_text_hash": "d1a95907297632125833e585f1235d6e67bd9591533f9b12ca173455d0b48701",
      "translation_text_hash": "6384f8888951aa95d0515b6c8ae9897fd92014d2a9f0f41c9f7fa3b22e50064c",
