      ],
      "en": "When evening had come, his disciples came to him, saying, “This place is deserted, and the hour is already late. Send the multitudes away, that they may go into the villages, and buy themselves food.”",
      "ko": "저녁이 되매 제자들이 나아와 가로되 이곳은 빈 들이요 때도 이미 저물었으니 무리를 보내어 마을에 들어가 먹을 것을 사먹게 하소서",
      "source_text_hash": "aabee7de82eee025967aea88b9973bea1a0c5fd74a24c68f162f34c08468de4c",
      "translation_text_hash": "45544ea62d36b81e42cabf22936998d2b22be9e99ffaad51d07239bccec51032",
